Photo enhancement: clarity enhancement: enlarging the image while repairing its quality; Contrast enhancement: AI adjusts the color of the image;
Super Magnification: Currently, there are good image enlargement and repair enlargement methods that can repair and enlarge images without changing the original image, with a maximum support for 8K enlargement;
ID photo: supports the generation of ID photos in multiple sizes;
Style redrawing: Supports various style filters such as clay filters, 3D figurines, building blocks, 3D cartoons, anime, etc., allowing for one click style redrawing;
Stretching repair: One click repair of stretched images;
Memory compression: compress and adjust the memory size of images;
Format conversion: Adjusting the format of images;
Black and white coloring: coloring black and white images;
Size scaling: pixel level resizing of images, supports batch processing.

